        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion 08, Navajo Collection Concha Knob </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLike its name, Fusion Hardware's Concha Knob mirrors southwestern design. It is fashioned to look like the detailing found on cowboy's saddles. Made out of solid brass, it is available in antique pewter and antique copper finishes. It will fit 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion 08 Concha Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion knob spring assembly for lifetime performance</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Southwest Door Knob Fusion 08:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter:  2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection:  2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass and Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): </b>For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Concha Solid Brass Knob, Fusion 08",
                "description": "Fusion 08 Concha Door Knob - Like its name, Fusion Hardware's Concha Knob mirrors southwestern design. It is fashioned to look like the detailing found on cowboy's saddles. Made out of solid brass, it is available in Antique Pewter and Antique Copper finishes. It will fit 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
